Package: kwin-input
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: send input and take screenshots on KDE Plasma Wayland
 Sends keyboard and mouse input and takes screenshots on KDE Plasma (Wayland)
 from the command line or another program, without root or uinput. KWin
 trusts it through the installed .desktop file, so any program that can run
 kwin-input can see the screen and type.
